  "description": "GIMMOI crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C78 H81 Dy6 N21 O45,5(C1 H4 O1),2(H2 O1),C2 H3 N1. From the CIF bond table, Dy1 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy2 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy3 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy4 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy5 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy6 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy7? (Dy) has 0 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 5 pairs, 2 components; largest component is a chain with approximately linear metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.709-3.941 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 88.78-112.82°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Dy6(bepho)3(NO3)6(CH3OH)3(H2O)3]·5CH3OH·CH3CN·2H2O. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 6 NO3 (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 3 H2O (explicit grouped unit in article formula).",
